{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d19fa43c733d0043e9d21bb6fe78ac76ff8072a0dc1ca1b95bd6364431dda35", "ja": "（海外でのイベントを無事に終えることができた。\nまさに大成功と言える内容だったな）", "zh": "（海外的活动顺利结束了。内容称得上是大获成功啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4822992a839538647a09aa3287bf02b004b67f67f0ab554cb5ede45b3c30e5c2", "ja": "（雪歩も歩も、慣れない環境でよく頑張ってくれた。\nしっかり労ってあげないと……ん？）", "zh": "（雪步和步也在不熟悉的环境里努力了很久。得好好慰劳她们才行……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6dfe31dbefe4962b7bf6e622ddff6b3d70e1ceeb406e93853131d0d704a16b5f", "ja": "い、いえす！　ウィーシング、アットアワーシアター！\n……あんど、えーっと……。あ、歩ちゃ～ん……。", "zh": "是、是的！我们在自己的剧场唱歌！……还有，那个……啊，步——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "996367fdb169a8f630d0600124fb8b1690a1aec77354f248fa6c87eb36d5391c", "ja": "はう……どこ行っちゃったんだろう……。\nあっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "呜……去哪儿了呢……啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1004_joseimc", "source_sha256": "4dea46caef904664298f493de2c4a3cf4e1519e3fa73eacc5d386e0cb9543c2e", "ja": "Hi！ I love her performance！\nSo amazing！ Perfect！ グッジョ～ブ♪", "zh": "Hi！ I love her performance！\nSo amazing！ Perfect！ 干得漂亮～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2f47f6950ad5ee5dabebce83d588469cb263d2010c7343763744622dc7c200c7", "ja": "オ、オウ！　サンキュー！　やったな雪歩、\nすごく褒められているぞ。グッジョ～ブ！", "zh": "哦、哦！谢谢！干得漂亮，雪步，\n你被夸得很厉害呢。太棒啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0855861066e3b1d9b02febdf2f5d3e1d1dccfea425cc0e624614e4d098317d4c", "ja": "わわっ、えっと、ありがとうござい……じゃなくて、\nサンキュー……！　ですぅ！", "zh": "哇哇，那个，非常感……不对，\n是Thank you……！呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1007_joseimc", "source_sha256": "718dda1d69c069878d3e9f91a42038a71e4c4501ea3636286419149ab57dbb61", "ja": "マタ、キテネ！\nアリガト、ゴザイマシタ～！", "zh": "下次再来哦！\n谢谢光临～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "89454f5a8ba7045a50deef2b0374dff3b0f9519c81a399df9378335d6d0b4794", "ja": "こ、こちらこそ。グッバイ！　しーゆー！\n……はぁ、ドキドキしちゃいましたぁ。", "zh": "我、我才要谢谢你。拜拜！下次见！  \n……哈，刚才紧张得心都怦怦跳了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "da702784d7d1a6b3c00815b68b4f3489f4555d6c0d82842029d23bcb5bba960b", "ja": "すまん。本当は通訳さんにも同行して\nほしかったんだが、手違いでな……。", "zh": "抱歉。本来是想让翻译也一起同行的，但因为出了点差错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f6516ea454faaee29c67b9929f72f3384c1b2acecad2e67d2073010ae6025bdc", "ja": "いえ、気にしないでくださいっ……みなさん優しくして\nくれたので、私なんかでもなんとかなりましたし。", "zh": "没事的，请别放在心上……大家都对我很好，\n就连我这样的人也总算应付过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a824f851059c4e2ecf31c7998966758b10a7fdac296e59ab8ff1d5233b7b7065", "ja": "確かにフレンドリーな人達だよな。お客さんもノリが\n良かったし、雪歩もやりやすかったんじゃないか？", "zh": "确实都是很好相处的人呢。观众的反应也很热烈，雪歩应该也觉得顺手多了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2ab4b9046bcf456228994e18a06b0757e4ca74865acc2c74e7a3fae53bf0296d", "ja": "はい。日本とは雰囲気が全然違って、最初はちょっと\nビックリしちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "是的。和日本的气氛完全不一样，刚开始确实有点\n吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cf1e2d4a4e5cacc1a0c7307f2d630b38d9bdeb4393d72d574cc367d996c066a7", "ja": "でも、みんなの楽しそうな顔とか、応援の声とかは\nいつもと変わらなくて……えへへ。", "zh": "不过，大家开心的表情，还有加油声，都和往常一样……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f108e9624fa1ef4185f106d2b4b1e10eb4dc03e62ee3fb293f4633ac2ebffae6", "ja": "そしたら、あっという間に出番が終わってました。\nもうちょっとだけ、歌いたかったかもです。", "zh": "然后，转眼间就结束了演出。\n或许还想再唱一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7db93669419667d6b8deee8f3f4c3a0d57516e5e786982a4a8af9406ea554a0b", "ja": "それは何よりだ。ステージも好感触だったし、\nまた声がかかるかもな。その時はよろしく頼むよ。", "zh": "那就再好不过了。舞台上的表现也很不错，说不定还会再次邀请你。到时候就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dab99cbc036de178baa4dfaf26b7fdb0f70c3d260d420b44d873c1e8c21e7ebf", "ja": "えっ、は、はいっ！　頑張りますぅ！\nつ、次は英語でMCができるようにならなきゃ……！", "zh": "诶，啊、好的！我会加油的！\n得、得学会下次用英语来主持才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "919ad56aa237eea0dc0e489bd4921fa7ac5d7df2a73528fb5005df3189039f78", "ja": "えっと、「掘る」は、確かディグで……。\nあの、「ちんちくりん」はなんて言うんですか？", "zh": "那个，“掘”应该是dig……\n请问，“矮矮小小”用英语怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6d9f7415c354527c6d006f7c81727fb4afff78f637ac1e11f8b411482f944c6c", "ja": "どんなMCをするつもりだ！？　でもまあ、\n向上心があるのはいいことだな。頑張ろう。", "zh": "你打算做什么样的主持啊！？不过嘛，\n有上进心是件好事。一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "06e81dd37ab383c29a31bc810d4df9b77c77544aacefe8af013516dae8a67f0d", "ja": "はい！　とってもいい経験ができました。素敵な\nお仕事を、サンキュー！　{$P$}！", "zh": "是的！我获得了一次非常棒的经历。谢谢你给我这么棒的工作！谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0334_1020_p", "source_sha256": "640710c2b8c6a1518f5abf12d5274bd37aba795a766413ff8a4558f969a5d190", "ja": "（ユアウェルカム！　いつかまた、この舞台に\n立てるように、俺も雪歩と一緒に頑張らないとな）", "zh": "（不客气！为了以后还能再次站上这个舞台，我也得和雪步一起努力才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
